<title>CANADA: Edper Group says Peter Bronfman dies.</title>
<headline>Edper Group says Peter Bronfman dies.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Edper Group said on Monday that senior chairman Peter Bronfman died in his Toronto home after a brief battle with cancer.</p>
<p>Bronfman founded the Edper Group, which is majority shareholder in Noranda Inc and London Insurance Group, and the former controlling shareholder of such companies as brewer John Labatt and MacMillan Bloedel.</p>
<p>He led the group for 40 years.</p>
<p>Bronfman had been scheduled to be presented with the Order of Canada today.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
